      "filename": "Uppingham, Ss Peter & Paul church (41092626265).jpg",
      "title": "File:Uppingham, Ss Peter & Paul church (41092626265).jpg",
      "url": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/Uppingham%2C_Ss_Peter_%26_Paul_church_%2841092626265%29.jpg",
      "descriptionUrl": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Uppingham,_Ss_Peter_%26_Paul_church_(41092626265).jpg",
